## Handoff state

- Review the durable goal and authority register.
- Review every `*.project-management.proposed*` file before merging.
- Keep optional modules limited to confirmed domains: {{MODULES_EN}}

## Status vocabulary

Use `planned`, `in progress`, `waiting for input`, `blocked`, `complete`, or `archived`. Explain a blocker and the required external change.

## Maintenance

Update when the user declares, completes, blocks, resumes, or changes the scope of a task. When work completes or changes materially, keep the concise task status here and record the outcome, evidence, limits, and handoff paths in `WORK_PROGRESS.en.md`. Move superseded detail to the archive when useful while retaining a traceable pointer.
